# Code owners — review routing for Nightgauge.
# Every pull request REQUESTS review from the maintainers team; it does not
# require one. The main-branch ruleset (.github/rulesets/main-branch.json)
# requires zero approving reviews — single maintainer — and gates merges on
# its 14 required status checks instead.
* @nightgauge/maintainers

# The publication-boundary allowlist gates the pipeline's own output, so the
# pipeline may not change it (#1970). An allowlist change is its own pull
# request (scripts/check-boundary-allowlist-isolation.sh) routed to maintainers.
/.github/publication-boundary.yaml @nightgauge/maintainers
